      },
      "text": "```\nPHYSIOLOGY: How the body's organs work individually and together\n            to maintain a stable internal environment (homeostasis)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-PHYSIOLOGY.md#005",
      "path": [
        "06-PHYSIOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:biology:06-physiology, git-history:biology:06-physiology]",
        "canonical_path": "biology/06-PHYSIOLOGY.md",
        "concepts": "[physiology]",
