        "section": "biology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "06 - Physiology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HOMEOSTASIS PRINCIPLE (Claude Bernard, Walter Cannon):\n  Maintain constant internal environment despite external variation\n  Mechanism: negative feedback loops\n  Variable: set point → sensor → comparator → effector → correction"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-PHYSIOLOGY.md#006",
      "path": [
        "06-PHYSIOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:biology:06-physiology, git-history:biology:06-physiology]",
        "canonical_path": "biology/06-PHYSIOLOGY.md",
