        "root_concepts": "[physiology]",
        "section": "biology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "06 - Physiology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "INTEGRATION:\n  Nervous + Endocrine work together (neuroendocrine axis)\n  Cardiovascular + Respiratory tightly coupled (O₂ delivery)\n  Kidney + Cardiovascular: blood pressure regulation\n  Immune + all others: recognizes and responds to damage\n```"
    },
