      "text": "AUTONOMIC NERVOUS SYSTEM:\n  Sympathetic (\"fight or flight\"):\n    Preganglionic: ACh (nicotinic receptor)\n    Postganglionic: norepinephrine (adrenergic receptors α₁, α₂, β₁, β₂)\n    Effects: ↑ heart rate, ↑ BP, bronchodilation, ↑ glucose (glycogenolysis)"
    },
