      "text": "Conduction velocity:\n    Unmyelinated (C fibers): 0.5-2 m/s (pain, temperature)\n    Myelinated (Aβ): 30-70 m/s (touch, pressure)\n    Myelinated (Aα): 70-120 m/s (proprioception, motor)\n    Saltatory conduction: AP jumps node-to-node in myelinated axons"
    },
