      "text": "SYNAPTIC TRANSMISSION:\n  AP arrives → voltage-gated Ca²⁺ channels open → Ca²⁺ influx\n  → synaptic vesicles fuse (SNARE proteins) → neurotransmitter release\n  → binds postsynaptic receptor → EPSP (excitatory) or IPSP (inhibitory)"
    },
