      "text": "Key neurotransmitters:\n    Glutamate: primary excitatory (AMPA, NMDA, kainate receptors)\n    GABA: primary inhibitory (GABA-A ionotropic, GABA-B metabotropic)\n    Acetylcholine (ACh): neuromuscular junction, autonomic, CNS\n    Dopamine: reward, motor control (nigrostriatal), PFC (cognitive)\n    Serotonin (5-HT): mood, sleep, appetite (gut-brain)\n    Norepinephrine: arousal, attention, sympathetic"
    },
