      "text": "BRAIN REGIONS (functional map):\n  Cerebral cortex: perception, cognition, voluntary movement\n    Frontal: executive function, motor planning, working memory, Broca's area\n    Parietal: somatosensory, spatial processing\n    Temporal: auditory, language comprehension (Wernicke's), memory\n    Occipital: visual processing\n  Hippocampus: spatial memory, episodic memory consolidation (H.M. case)\n  Amygdala: fear, emotion, threat detection\n  Basal ganglia: motor learning, habit formation, reward circuits\n  Cerebellum: motor coordination, balance, motor learning\n  Thalamus: sensory relay (all sensory except olfaction)\n  Hypothalamus: homeostasis (temperature, hunger, thirst, sleep), HPA axis\n  Brainstem: vital functions (respiration, heart rate, consciousness, cranial nerves)"
    }
